  "id": "maple-garlic-marinated-pork-tenderloin",
  "name": "Maple-Garlic Marinated Pork Tenderloin",
  "subtitle": "Sweet maple marinade with savory garlic and mustard",
  "description": "Pork tenderloin is marinated in a maple-garlic mixture, then grilled until tender and safely cooked.",
